  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Managua Municipal. Modernization</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Modernizacin Municipal Alcalda Managua</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM INTENDS TO SUPPORT THE IMPROVEMENT AND DEEPENING OF GOVERNABILITY IN THE MUNICIPALITY BY FINANCING TECHNICAL ASSSISTANCE AND INVESTMENT IN PILOT PROJECTS TO STRENGTHEN THE INSTITUTIONAL CAPACITY AT THE MUNICIPAL AND DISTRICT LEVELS, AND TO FAVOR CITIZEN PARTICIPATION IN IDENTIFYING, PREPARING AND EXECUTING THESE PROJECTS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
